\item OpenAI, \emph{Taming implies compatibility on four-manifolds}, 2026-09-23; citation key \texttt{OAI:Taming-implies-compatibility-on-four-manifolds-September-23-2026}. \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Taming-implies-compatibility-on-four-manifolds-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (GitHub)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/raw/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Taming-implies-compatibility-on-four-manifolds-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{PDF (direct)}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Taming-implies-compatibility-on-four-manifolds-September-23-2026/README.md}{Manuscript page and citation}; \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/main/preprints/Taming-implies-compatibility-on-four-manifolds-September-23-2026/paper.pdf}{Latest version}; Statement source: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/preprints/Taming-implies-compatibility-on-four-manifolds-September-23-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex\#L23}{thm:main}.
\item Family 342: \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/docs/342.md}{Lean scope}.
\item \href{https://github.com/openai/math/blob/adc7f1241b42e322a6451854ab7e4b4c146bf78a/lean/ComparatorChallenges/TamingCompatibility.json}{Comparator TamingCompatibility.json}.
